{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/e457cd3eed62e6024b8defc7051c1776.avif?t=1758942824\" width=810 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/0ea08df69335ba41338a7296a25869e6.webp?t=1758942824\" width=1560 height=37 /></span><strong>The Freddy you once knew is gone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of intense training and dangerous missions in the farthest corners of space, <strong>Freddy Hardest is no longer a clueless playboy\u2014he\u2019s now a lethal warrior, ready for any challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But his return to Earth doesn\u2019t go as planned: upon landing in New York, he finds himself in the middle of an unexpected nightmare\u2026 <strong>a zombie apocalypse threatening to consume the city\u2014and maybe the entire world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This marks the beginning of his greatest mission yet: uncovering the origin of the plague, battling endless hordes of the undead, and surviving in a collapsed metropolis using every skill he mastered during his years of space training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/0ea08df69335ba41338a7296a25869e6.webp?t=1758942824\" width=1560 height=37 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/b4eae30b1c29a97464505e0c321aa387.avif?t=1758942824\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/0ea08df69335ba41338a7296a25869e6.webp?t=1758942824\" width=1560 height=37 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Freddy Hardest like you\u2019ve never seen him before</strong>: agile, powerful, and armed to the teeth, ready to face an army of zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfd <strong>Apocalypse in New York</strong>: explore a city overrun by the undead, from ruined skyscrapers to infested subway stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Relentless combat</strong>: fight hand-to-hand, unleash futuristic weapons, and use tactics learned on distant planets against endless waves of zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>A dark and mysterious story</strong>: investigate who\u2014or what\u2014caused the apocalypse, and make choices that will decide humanity\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Non-stop action</strong>: platforming, exploration, and explosive firefights with no room to breathe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fight alongside Freddy and save what\u2019s left of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/0ea08df69335ba41338a7296a25869e6.webp?t=1758942824\" width=1560 height=37 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/extras/5b4e7a262e89cd40c780a7b26cb08f4e.avif?t=1758942824\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014140?t=1758942824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/0fb55df5e34fcf46af0252ab5dcf40e56d7518dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758942824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014140/88dcca1964444be9c71711317972b3